WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.096 --> 00:00:03.347
- Everything that I learned
in the Navy is not built

00:00:03.347 --> 00:00:04.525
for this game at all.

00:00:04.525 --> 00:00:09.523
(upbeat music)

00:00:09.523 --> 00:00:11.007
My name is Jonathan Dock Farrow,

00:00:11.007 --> 00:00:12.896
I was a Corpsman in the United States Navy

00:00:12.896 --> 00:00:14.542
serving with the United
States Marine Corps.

00:00:14.542 --> 00:00:16.655
- I am Lisa. I was an
Intelligence Specialist.

00:00:16.655 --> 00:00:19.784
- I was a medic, the guy who
patched you up if you got shot.

00:00:19.784 --> 00:00:23.075
- I served in Virginia Beach, Bahrain

00:00:23.075 --> 00:00:25.635
and on the USS Bonhomme Richard.

00:00:25.635 --> 00:00:28.134
- The last time that I played Battleship,

00:00:28.134 --> 00:00:30.105
we'll say 25 years ago.

00:00:30.105 --> 00:00:33.823
- 1984 was the last time
I played, nope, 1986.

00:00:33.823 --> 00:00:36.141
- I'm gonna won, simply because I'm Doc.

00:00:36.141 --> 00:00:38.739
- I was actually stationed on a ship,

00:00:38.739 --> 00:00:40.730
so I think I'm gonna kick his ass.

00:00:40.730 --> 00:00:45.730
(dramatic music)

00:00:57.167 --> 00:00:57.756
- [Jonathan] Great.

00:00:57.756 --> 00:00:58.691
- Let's do it.

00:00:58.691 --> 00:01:00.316
- [Jonathan] You'll never
think to shoot me there.

00:01:00.316 --> 00:01:02.165
- Somebody's gonna lose his fleet.

00:01:02.165 --> 00:01:03.932
- This is not strategically
how a carrier group

00:01:03.932 --> 00:01:04.948
would be by the way.

00:01:04.948 --> 00:01:06.310
- And you know this how?

00:01:06.310 --> 00:01:07.407
- [Jonathan] Well, how would you know?

00:01:07.407 --> 00:01:10.190
- I was on an amphibious
assault ship. Ready?

00:01:10.190 --> 00:01:11.612
(laughing)

00:01:11.612 --> 00:01:12.872
B2.

00:01:12.872 --> 00:01:13.725
- [Jonathan] Direct hit.

00:01:13.725 --> 00:01:16.305
- (claps) Yes! (laughs)

00:01:16.305 --> 00:01:17.992
- D4.

00:01:17.992 --> 00:01:19.922
- Miss. As I suspected.

00:01:19.922 --> 00:01:20.856
- [Jonathan] I'm sorry what was that?

00:01:20.856 --> 00:01:21.710
- Hit.

00:01:21.710 --> 00:01:22.949
- Direct hit, okay, great.

00:01:22.949 --> 00:01:23.782
- [Lisa] Direct hit.

00:01:23.782 --> 00:01:24.615
- Sweet.

00:01:26.697 --> 00:01:28.749
I'm chasing after ya. I'm adjusting fire.

00:01:28.749 --> 00:01:31.271
- D2, I'm already gonna put it in there.

00:01:31.271 --> 00:01:33.222
- D2.
- [Lisa] Yes.

00:01:33.222 --> 00:01:34.034
- It's my shot, right?

00:01:34.034 --> 00:01:34.888
- Time's a wasting.
- [Jonathan] Okay.

00:01:34.888 --> 00:01:36.066
(laughing)

00:01:36.066 --> 00:01:37.576
F8.

00:01:37.671 --> 00:01:38.362
- Miss.

00:01:38.362 --> 00:01:39.459
- I'm sorry.
- [Lisa] E2.

00:01:39.459 --> 00:01:41.369
- You sank my battleship.

00:01:41.369 --> 00:01:43.418
(beeping)

00:01:43.418 --> 00:01:44.292
(Lisa laughing)
- [Jonathan] Oh, it's funny?

00:01:44.292 --> 00:01:45.520
- Pruned your ass.

00:01:46.446 --> 00:01:47.505
You got your (beep) together now?

00:01:47.505 --> 00:01:49.415
- My (beep) always been together.

00:01:49.415 --> 00:01:50.552
I don't know what you're talking about.

00:01:50.552 --> 00:01:52.140
- You sunk my patrol boat!

00:01:52.140 --> 00:01:53.133
(beeping)
- [Jonathan] That's right.

00:01:53.133 --> 00:01:53.966
- Miss.

00:01:53.966 --> 00:01:54.697
- Miss.

00:01:54.697 --> 00:01:55.327
- Miss.

00:01:55.327 --> 00:01:57.630
D5.

00:01:57.724 --> 00:01:58.435
- Hit.

00:01:58.435 --> 00:02:00.162
- (claps) Yes.

00:02:00.162 --> 00:02:00.793
Miss.

00:02:00.793 --> 00:02:01.564
- Miss.

00:02:01.564 --> 00:02:02.194
- Miss.

00:02:02.194 --> 00:02:04.449
- God bless America.

00:02:04.449 --> 00:02:07.903
- You're going down, you're going down.

00:02:07.903 --> 00:02:08.858
- You sank my destroyer.

00:02:08.858 --> 00:02:11.499
(beeping)

00:02:11.499 --> 00:02:12.373
- How you feeling?

00:02:12.373 --> 00:02:13.206
- Dying over here.

00:02:13.206 --> 00:02:14.242
- Starting to sweat a little bit.

00:02:14.242 --> 00:02:16.436
(Lisa laughing)
- I sweat all the time,

00:02:16.436 --> 00:02:17.086
shut up.

00:02:17.086 --> 00:02:18.691
- Hit.
(Jonathan laughing)

00:02:18.691 --> 00:02:19.464
- Hit.

00:02:19.464 --> 00:02:20.134
- Hit.

00:02:20.134 --> 00:02:21.517
I wasted a missile.

00:02:21.517 --> 00:02:22.613
- [Jonathan] I know, I know.

00:02:22.613 --> 00:02:25.315
- I don't remember this being
so stressful when I was 12.

00:02:25.315 --> 00:02:26.453
- Really? It is stressful.

00:02:26.453 --> 00:02:28.992
- G8. I sunk your battleship!

00:02:28.992 --> 00:02:31.735
(beeping)

00:02:31.735 --> 00:02:33.462
- No! You sunk my courier!

00:02:33.462 --> 00:02:34.376
