00:02:34.376 --> 00:02:35.108
- Hey!

00:02:35.108 --> 00:02:36.875
- Is he bringing packages to your ship?

00:02:36.875 --> 00:02:39.455
- Ha! I just sunk some
(beep) right there, didn't I?

00:02:39.455 --> 00:02:40.756
- You got a direct hit.

00:02:40.756 --> 00:02:42.259
