00:02:45.551 --> 00:02:47.399
- [Lisa] No! You sunk my battleship!

00:02:47.399 --> 00:02:49.676
- I didn't sink your
battleship! I sank your courier!

00:02:49.676 --> 00:02:51.016
- You didn't sink my courier.

00:02:51.016 --> 00:02:52.052
