00:03:03.450 --> 00:03:04.425
(Lisa laughing)

00:03:04.425 --> 00:03:05.441
- I'm so excited.

00:03:05.441 --> 00:03:06.680
(laughing)

00:03:06.680 --> 00:03:07.595
