you don't have time.

00:03:16.718 --> 00:03:17.612
- E8.

00:03:17.612 --> 00:03:18.404
- Yes.

00:03:18.404 --> 00:03:20.822
J9.

00:03:20.822 --> 00:03:21.939
(shouting)

00:03:21.939 --> 00:03:23.443
(beeping)
- [Jonathan] Yes!

00:03:23.443 --> 00:03:25.982
(laughing)

00:03:25.982 --> 00:03:27.018
- You sunk my whole fleet.

00:03:27.018 --> 00:03:28.928
I went in there with a good game plan

00:03:28.928 --> 00:03:30.960
